WEBVTT

1
00:00:18.341 --> 00:00:21.642
smiled. "That monster was cool, right?"

2
00:00:22.723 --> 00:00:23.804
She held up a controller.

3
00:00:23.824 --> 00:00:27.286
"This can make any hologram I want."

4
00:00:28.526 --> 00:00:31.348
She pressed a button, causing a huge octopus to appear.

5
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.481
Cozlin played with the buttons on the controller.

6
00:00:37.561 --> 00:00:41.402
A tidal wave rose from the ground, and then a spaceship zoomed toward them.

7
00:00:42.082 --> 00:00:43.662
Roxy ducked to avoid getting hit.

8
00:00:45.243 --> 00:00:47.964
"They're not real!"

9
00:00:48.924 --> 00:00:51.024
Laughing, Cozlin made everything vanish.

10
00:00:55.086 --> 00:00:56.006
Roxy glared at her.

11
00:00:56.026 --> 00:00:58.566
"Why did you make that monster?

12
00:00:58.927 --> 00:01:00.187
That was dangerous!"

13
00:01:01.247 --> 00:01:02.127
Cozlin shrugged.

14
00:01:02.147 --> 00:01:03.868
"It didn't hurt anyone."

15
00:01:05.436 --> 00:01:08.757
"No," Roxy said, "but people were scared!"

16
00:01:09.878 --> 00:01:11.018
Cozlin rolled her eyes.

17
00:01:11.038 --> 00:01:13.619
"I needed to find you.

18
00:01:13.639 --> 00:01:18.621
I looked all over and realized I had no idea where you might be.

19
00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:28.785
But then I said to myself, 'A big monster will get Rocket Girl's attention!'"

20
00:01:29.606 --> 00:01:31.526
Cozlin chuckled.

21
00:01:32.207 --> 00:01:32.907
Roxy frowned.

22
00:01:32.927 --> 00:01:36.749
"Okay." Cozlin held up her hands.

23
00:01:36.769 --> 00:01:38.991
"Maybe it wasn't a good idea.

24
00:01:39.411 --> 00:01:41.993
But King Radnik said I needed your help."

25
00:01:42.013 --> 00:01:44.234
"Who's King Radnik?"

26
00:01:44.755 --> 00:01:45.455
Roxy asked.

27
00:01:45.475 --> 00:01:49.218
"The king of Delkor," Cozlin said.

28
00:01:49.238 --> 00:01:55.382
"A robot army is invading our planet, and he's really worried.

29
00:01:56.143 --> 00:01:58.885
So he insisted I ask you for help.

30
00:02:00.226 --> 00:02:03.328
I told him all about you after the first time I was here."

31
00:02:04.928 --> 00:02:08.149
"A robot army sounds serious," Roxy said.

32
00:02:09.289 --> 00:02:10.129
Cozlin shrugged.

33
00:02:10.149 --> 00:02:13.070
"I'm sure I can handle it.

34
00:02:13.850 --> 00:02:16.111
And I'm sure you have other things to do."

35
00:02:17.592 --> 00:02:18.392
Roxy sighed.

36
00:02:18.412 --> 00:02:20.972
"I'd be happy to help you.

37
00:02:21.773 --> 00:02:23.473
But I don't know if I should leave Earth.

38
00:02:24.393 --> 00:02:25.974
What if someone robs a bank?

39
00:02:26.434 --> 00:02:29.335
What if huge bugs suddenly swarm the city?

40
00:02:29.875 --> 00:02:31.135
My city needs me."

41
00:02:32.336 --> 00:02:33.756
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

42
00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:38.842
Usually only Roxy could hear it, but Cozlin looked down at it too.

43
00:02:38.862 --> 00:02:40.462
"What's that?"

44
00:02:40.822 --> 00:02:41.543
Cozlin asked.

45
00:02:41.563 --> 00:02:44.424
"It's an emergency," Roxy said.

46
00:02:45.684 --> 00:02:46.905
She flipped open the watch.

47
00:02:47.845 --> 00:02:49.306
All she could see was darkness.

48
00:02:49.326 --> 00:02:52.287
"Mayor Bloom!

49
00:02:52.627 --> 00:02:53.187
What's wrong?

50
00:02:54.308 --> 00:02:56.049
Mayor Bloom?"

51
00:02:57.529 --> 00:03:00.290
Mayor Bloom's face suddenly appeared, looking confused.

52
00:03:01.591 --> 00:03:02.191
"Rocket Girl?

53
00:03:02.952 --> 00:03:03.832
Is everything okay?

54
00:03:04.404 --> 00:03:05.705
Did you get rid of that monster?"

55
00:03:05.725 --> 00:03:08.368
"Yep!" Roxy said.

56
00:03:08.388 --> 00:03:10.129
"Is that why you called?"

57
00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:13.812
"I didn't call you," Mayor Bloom said.

58
00:03:13.832 --> 00:03:17.675
"Um, you did, Mayor," Roxy said.

59
00:03:17.695 --> 00:03:19.437
"I did?"

60
00:03:20.738 --> 00:03:21.579
Mayor Bloom chuckled.

61
00:03:21.599 --> 00:03:24.781
"Oops. I guess I sat on my phone."

62
00:03:25.702 --> 00:03:26.503
Roxy sighed.

63
00:03:26.523 --> 00:03:29.445
"So, nothing's wrong?"

64
00:03:29.465 --> 00:03:32.108
"Nope!" Mayor Bloom smiled.

65
00:03:32.836 --> 00:03:34.457
"I'm just organizing my desk."

66
00:03:36.818 --> 00:03:37.959
Roxy closed her watch.

67
00:03:37.979 --> 00:03:40.801
"Kid Comet, I'll go with you."

68
00:03:40.821 --> 00:03:42.742
"Are you sure?"

69
00:03:43.142 --> 00:03:43.942
Cozlin asked.

70
00:03:43.962 --> 00:03:47.804
"I can just tell King Radnik you were busy."

71
00:03:47.824 --> 00:03:50.766
"No," Roxy said.

72
00:03:50.786 --> 00:03:53.288
"You need my help, so I'll help you.

73
00:03:54.168 --> 00:03:58.791
But promise me that you'll never scare the people of Metro City like that again."

74
00:04:02.708 --> 00:04:03.449
"I promise.

75
00:04:04.029 --> 00:04:08.092
I don't think this will take long at all—probably just an hour or two.

76
00:04:08.853 --> 00:04:11.755
In fact, I could easily handle it on my own.

77
00:04:12.556 --> 00:04:16.458
But with your help, it'll get done faster," Cozlin said.

78
00:04:16.478 --> 00:04:20.081
Roxy gave Cozlin a funny look.

79
00:04:20.101 --> 00:04:24.184
"You know, there's nothing wrong with needing help."

80
00:04:25.785 --> 00:04:26.686
Cozlin shrugged.

81
00:04:26.706 --> 00:04:28.748
"I like to work alone."

82
00:04:32.472 --> 00:04:34.674
They got into Cozlin's spaceship and blasted off.

83
00:04:37.055 --> 00:04:41.919
A power crystal in the control panel glowed brightly, and soon they were approaching Delkor.

84
00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:45.461
The spaceship flew over Delkor's capital.

85
00:04:46.782 --> 00:04:50.645
Looking down, both Roxy and Cozlin gasped.

86
00:04:52.526 --> 00:04:54.948
The entire city was filled with robots!
